    <a class="btn secondary" href="/api">Browse the API</a>
  </div>
  <h2>Guides</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/getting-started">Quick start</a>: install, first schema, first error.</li>
    <li><a href="/api">API</a>: every factory, modifier, and output shape.</li>
    <li><a href="/i18n">i18n</a>: language switching, issue structure, custom locales.</li>
    <li><a href="/benchmark">Benchmark</a>: method, scripts, and measured results.</li>
